extends /specs/products/corp/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Usage

    section.source_section
        h2 Inputs

        h3 Text input
        .source_example
            .input-group
                input(type="text" placeholder="Text input")

        h3 Select list
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `select` element. In this case we must also add `options` array.
        .source_example
            .input-group
                select
                    option Lorem
                    option Ipsum
                    option Dolor

        h3 Search input
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `input` element with `input-search` class.
        .source_example
            .input-group
                .input-with-icon
                    input(type="text" placeholder="Text input")
                    i.icon-search


        h3 Textarea
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `textarea` element, and we also use `rows` and `cols` attributes.
        .source_example
            .input-group
                label(for="example-textarea") Example Textarea
                textarea(rows="20" cols="40" placeholder="Example" id="example-textarea")

        h3 Label with input
        .source_example
            fieldset.input-group
                label(for="example-input1") label
                input(type="text" placeholder="Example" id="example-input1")

        h3 left side Label with input
        .source_example
            .input-group.left-side-label
                label(for="example-input") label
                input(type="text" placeholder="Example" id="example-input")

        h3 Radio button
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `radio` element
        .source_example
            .input-group
                label.radio
                    input(type="radio", name="radio1", value="1", checked)
                    span(class="label-txt") Value 1
                label.radio
                    input(type="radio", name="radio1", value="2")
                    span(class="label-txt") Value 2
                label.radio
                    input(type="radio", name="radio1", value="3")
                    span(class="label-txt") Value 3

        h3 Checkbox
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `checkbox` element.
        .source_example
            .input-group
                label.checkbox
                    input(type="checkbox", name="checkbox[]", value="1", checked)
                    span(class="label-txt") Example label
                label.checkbox
                    input(type="checkbox", name="checkbox[]", value="2")
                    span(class="label-txt") Example label
                label.checkbox
                    input(type="checkbox", name="checkbox[]", value="3")
                    span(class="label-txt") Example label

        h3 File
        markdown
            p In the example below we are creating `file` element.
        .source_example
            .input-group
                label Example label
                input(type="file")



    | #{''}